      "changelog": "https://github.com/Andromi-Auto/andromi-auto/releases",
      "suggestedVersionCode": "2000000034",
      "description": "Andromi Auto runs Android Auto on your phone and shows it in its own window, so HyperOS\n\"Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" can mirror it to the car screen.\n\n* Self mode: no USB cable or wireless head unit needed\n* Material 3 design with wallpaper (Monet) colours\n* Portrait and landscape switch for the different car window sizes\n* Optional automatic start when the car's Bluetooth connects (needs root setup)\n* Built-in update check for stable releases\n\nBased on Open Headunit (AGPL-3.0). Unofficial; not affiliated with Google, Xiaomi or Baidu.\nUses the install id com.baidu.searchbox, so it cannot be installed next to the real Baidu app.",
      "issueTracker": "https://github.com/Andromi-Auto/andromi-auto/issues",
      "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
      "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Andromi-Auto/andromi-auto",
      "summary": "Android Auto on the phone, shown on a Xiaomi car screen",
      "webSite": "https://github.com/Andromi-Auto/andromi-auto",
      "added": 1793267946000,
      "packageName": "com.baidu.searchbox",
      "lastUpdated": 1793267947000,
